              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore eloito te mbata e naiposha e Galilaya nedol ilalashera oare, Simon oji Petero o lalashe lenye Anterea, enang'aki o rreshet atua enaiposha, amu ilarreshok apa loo sinkir. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
